1:49:29.100 --> 1:49:31.200
How did we end up this way

1:49:31.370 --> 1:49:35.490
What did we do wrong?

1:49:35.690 --> 1:49:38.240
God

1:49:52.400 --> 1:49:55.270
Even though the days go on

1:49:55.320 --> 1:49:58.180
So far so far away from

1:49:58.240 --> 1:50:02.710
It seems so close

1:50:04.090 --> 1:50:07.030
